WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.143 --> 00:00:03.574
(energetic music)

00:00:05.194 --> 00:00:07.092
- Feast Mode Hunger Squad, back at it again.

00:00:07.092 --> 00:00:09.044
- We're gonna drive all over Los Angeles--

00:00:09.044 --> 00:00:11.381
- And look for the best PB and J sandwich.

00:00:11.381 --> 00:00:12.937
- But instead of our usual telephone,

00:00:12.937 --> 00:00:15.096
we're gonna play literal telephone--

00:00:15.096 --> 00:00:18.254
- But we will be telephoning
Keith, to ask where to go.

00:00:18.254 --> 00:00:19.783
- Why is Keith in the
video all of a sudden?

00:00:19.783 --> 00:00:20.855
Who cares! That's why!

00:00:20.855 --> 00:00:21.911
We're mixin' it up!

00:00:21.911 --> 00:00:23.734
And, because today feast-mode, for work,

00:00:23.734 --> 00:00:25.340
gets to eat peanut butter.

00:00:25.340 --> 00:00:26.374
And I'm jelly.

00:00:26.374 --> 00:00:27.683
- If you haven't noticed, I'm white.

00:00:27.683 --> 00:00:29.051
Therefore, I've eaten more

00:00:29.051 --> 00:00:31.396
peanut butter and jelly
sandwiches than anything else.

00:00:31.396 --> 00:00:32.139
- The most important thing

00:00:32.139 --> 00:00:34.574
in a peanut butter and jelly sandwich is

00:00:34.574 --> 00:00:36.574
peanut butter to jelly ratio.

00:00:36.574 --> 00:00:39.012
- You may have noticed
that I am leaning against

00:00:39.012 --> 00:00:40.774
the good ol' nacho wagon,

00:00:40.774 --> 00:00:43.284
making it's second appearance
in feast-mode hunger squad.

00:00:44.564 --> 00:00:46.252
- PB and J!

00:00:46.252 --> 00:00:47.609
- Alright, get in the van, guys.

00:00:47.609 --> 00:00:48.026
- Alright.

00:00:48.026 --> 00:00:50.568
So we are on our way to
Mendocino Farms, right now.

00:00:50.568 --> 00:00:52.588
- We're about to eat
peanut butter and jelly

00:00:52.588 --> 00:00:54.471
on quinoa millet bread.

00:00:54.471 --> 00:00:57.628
So basically, they don't put
the PB and J on their menu

00:00:57.628 --> 00:00:59.463
cause they're hoping
that it's just gonna grow

00:00:59.463 --> 00:01:00.555
by word-of-mouth.

00:01:00.555 --> 00:01:02.407
- It's like a hidden item.
- Secret menu.

00:01:02.407 --> 00:01:03.918
- And now we are telling the world.

00:01:03.918 --> 00:01:05.290
- Mmm!

00:01:05.290 --> 00:01:06.605
- Collin!

00:01:07.465 --> 00:01:08.928
- The white bread version, thus far,

00:01:08.928 --> 00:01:11.166
to me it has like the classic PB and J.

00:01:11.166 --> 00:01:12.331
I love the flavor.

00:01:12.331 --> 00:01:13.326
Love the crunch.

00:01:13.326 --> 00:01:14.872
- Let's not sleep on the gluten-free.

00:01:14.872 --> 00:01:15.569
It's really good.

00:01:15.569 --> 00:01:17.869
It actually kinda tastes like PB and J

00:01:17.869 --> 00:01:20.175
on like a Triscuit, or like a Wheat Thin.

00:01:20.175 --> 00:01:22.450
- The ratio is actually perfect.

00:01:22.450 --> 00:01:22.868
- [Collin] Yeah.

00:01:22.868 --> 00:01:25.004
- It's a slightly more
jelly, than peanut butter.

00:01:25.004 --> 00:01:26.085
Time to call Keith, guys?

00:01:26.085 --> 00:01:27.775
- Hello, Keith.

00:01:27.775 --> 00:01:29.811
- (laughing) Hello, Collin.

00:01:29.811 --> 00:01:30.962
How are you?

00:01:30.962 --> 00:01:32.272
- I'm fantastic.

00:01:32.272 --> 00:01:34.246
- How was the kid's menu PB and J?

00:01:34.246 --> 00:01:37.194
- Definitely one of the
best kid's menu PB and J's

00:01:37.194 --> 00:01:38.425
I've ever had.

00:01:38.425 --> 00:01:39.261
- Well, that's incredible.

00:01:39.261 --> 00:01:40.213
Now I'm sending you somewhere

00:01:40.213 --> 00:01:42.240
where you can actually
order of the adult menu.

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:43.881
You're headed to Joan's on Third.

00:01:43.881 --> 00:01:45.928
- We're going to Joan's on Third!

00:01:46.608 --> 00:01:48.850
- I just ordered our four

00:01:48.850 --> 00:01:50.615
peanut butter and jelly sandwiches.

00:01:50.615 --> 00:01:51.404
- Yum.

00:01:51.404 --> 00:01:52.055
- [Dark-haired male] Alright.

00:01:52.055 --> 00:01:54.794
- Joan's on Third decided
to get all LA on us,

00:01:54.794 --> 00:01:57.999
and say we can't shoot
without a location sign-off

00:01:57.999 --> 00:01:59.786
from blah-blah, what-what.

00:01:59.786 --> 00:02:01.249
We're eatin' in the van!

00:02:01.249 --> 00:02:03.108
- What have you done in this
van, other than eat in it?

00:02:03.108 --> 00:02:03.966
- You don't wanna know, Steven.

00:02:03.966 --> 00:02:05.446
- (laughing) Okay! Movin' on.

00:02:05.446 --> 00:02:07.733
- So they gave us these
dainty, delicious-looking

00:02:07.733 --> 00:02:09.521
little peanut butter and jelly sandwiches.

00:02:09.521 --> 00:02:10.589
They smell good.

00:02:10.589 --> 00:02:11.773
They have good weight to them.

00:02:11.773 --> 00:02:12.818
- Already, off the bat,

00:02:12.818 --> 00:02:14.608
it seems like it has
too much peanut butter.

00:02:14.608 --> 00:02:16.812
- But it really isn't like, that special.

00:02:16.812 --> 00:02:19.250
Like it doesn't taste like
gourmet, you know what I mean?

00:02:19.250 --> 00:02:20.109
- I'm bored by it.

00:02:20.109 --> 00:02:22.315
- The bread is like
perfectly toasted, though.

00:02:22.315 --> 00:02:23.522
- Better call Keith.

00:02:23.522 --> 00:02:25.148
- Hello, Keith!

00:02:25.148 --> 00:02:28.140
- (laughing) Hello,
Collin, how's it going?

00:02:28.140 --> 00:02:30.515
- Joan's on Third was kind of a bummer.

00:02:30.515 --> 00:02:31.370
- Let me make it up to you.

00:02:31.370 --> 00:02:34.435
You're gonna go to
Doughboys, which is nearby.

00:02:34.435 --> 00:02:35.573
It's also on third.

00:02:35.573 --> 00:02:37.825
- Doughboys cafe on third, remember that.

00:02:37.825 --> 00:02:39.985
- This is an exquisite peanut
butter and jelly sandwich.

00:02:39.985 --> 00:02:42.095
I believed it's either
fried, grilled, or baked.

00:02:42.095 --> 00:02:43.806
A whole bunch of stuff is going into it.

00:02:43.806 --> 00:02:46.566
You're gonna love it, or
at least we hope you do.

00:02:47.676 --> 00:02:50.062
- So, we just tried to go
into Doughboys to get their

00:02:50.062 --> 00:02:53.003
gourmet peanut butter
chocolate banana sandwich,

00:02:53.003 --> 00:02:55.181
which is, I heard, amazing.

00:02:55.181 --> 00:02:56.284
They wouldn't allow us to film,

00:02:56.284 --> 00:02:57.933
so we're gonna get those joints to-go,

00:02:57.933 --> 00:03:00.222
and I guess, head back to the orange van.

00:03:00.222 --> 00:03:02.598
- Literally, what they do, is
they take all the ingredients,

00:03:02.598 --> 00:03:05.224
peanut butter, chocolate, jelly, bananas.

00:03:05.224 --> 00:03:06.876
They stuff it all together on the bread.

00:03:06.876 --> 00:03:10.703
They dip it in egg batter,
and then they grill that.

00:03:10.703 --> 00:03:13.234
They take that sandwich, they
bake it a little bit longer,

00:03:13.234 --> 00:03:15.092
so it bakes together,
and they serve it to you.

00:03:15.092 --> 00:03:16.206
That's why it takes so long.

00:03:16.206 --> 00:03:16.810
- Oh, my God.

00:03:16.810 --> 00:03:19.318
I will say, that this
thing is so overwhelming.

00:03:19.318 --> 00:03:21.302
Like I don't even know what I'm tasting.

00:03:21.302 --> 00:03:23.786
- I'm into it though, and
I love the banana aspect.

00:03:23.786 --> 00:03:24.937
- You know what the problem is, guys?

00:03:24.937 --> 00:03:25.840
- What?

00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:27.305
- The peanut butter to jelly ratio.

00:03:27.305 --> 00:03:29.464
- One thing I know, is that
this won't taste as good cold,

00:03:29.464 --> 00:03:32.138
so let's get a hot one
back to Keith, right now.

00:03:33.208 --> 00:03:34.836
- Here we go, here we go.

00:03:34.836 --> 00:03:35.700
Sandwich!

00:03:35.700 --> 00:03:36.918
- Oh my gosh!

00:03:36.918 --> 00:03:37.800
Oh my gosh!

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:39.596
Guys, did you have a good adventure?

00:03:39.596 --> 00:03:40.168
- Sure.

00:03:40.168 --> 00:03:40.749
- Yeah.

00:03:40.749 --> 00:03:41.963
It was good.

00:03:41.963 --> 00:03:43.303
- It was alright.

00:03:45.643 --> 00:03:46.600
- Well, they did it.

00:03:46.600 --> 00:03:49.177
Those feasties feasted the
fuck out of those sandwiches.

00:03:49.177 --> 00:03:50.199
And they brought me one!

00:03:50.199 --> 00:03:54.007
Which means in the end,
all you viewers, are jelly.

00:03:54.827 --> 00:03:56.398
Wait a minute though, wasn't
the Mendocino Farms one

00:03:56.398 --> 00:03:57.626
like, the really good one?

00:03:57.626 --> 00:03:58.827
- [Voiceover] Yeah, that was the best.

00:03:58.827 --> 00:04:00.578
- Then why didn't you bring me that one?

00:04:03.698 --> 00:04:06.150
(laughing) Powderpuff girls?

00:04:09.200 --> 00:04:11.119
Why is that your go-to?

00:04:12.019 --> 00:04:14.252
You a big powderpuff girl fan, Steven?

00:04:15.337 --> 00:04:16.618
Alright.

